My ranger on NAO reached the Quest today. I only intended to take a peek
at it, because I was only lvl 12. I jumped through the portal and heard my
mother call me down for tea. I went down with the message still on the
screen.

When I came back, my connection with NAO had been severed. I
reconnected and got the message that my game would be recovered. The
recovery succeeded and I landed on the first quest level. There was one
problem, though. The portal was inactive. I could see it, but I couldn't
go through it. Monsters would disappear when stepping on it, but I
wouldn't. No message was given.

After #chatting with Orion, I was returned to lvl 11. I went through the
for a second time. I had no problems getting back this time.

Wizmode reveals that this happens only when the shell gets killed. If
nethack itself is killed, you can only recover the level with the quest
portal.

Should I report this? If so, where?

